<h1>The post-mortem of 28 October</h1>
<p class="standfirst">This is the final report of the post-mortem of 28 October. The post-mortem studied the failed rewrite of POSITIONS entries on 26 October. The report says what the post-mortem found and what was done about it, up to the landing of the corrections and your answers on the evening of 29 October. It also says what the work taught, what it cost and what is still open.</p>
<p class="standfirst">Each section has a Select button beside its heading. The button selects the section's text for Speak. It leaves out the references at the section's end.</p>
</header>

