<ul>
<li>Point 2: <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/blob/main/explorations/coordinator/curator-profile/show.py">show.py</a>.</li>
<li>Point 3: <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/blob/main/explorations/coordinator/postmortem-2026-10-28/account.md">account.md</a>; <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/tree/main/explorations/coordinator/postmortem-2026-10-28/evidence">the folder evidence</a>.</li>
</ul>
